   "role": "greeting",
   "phrasing": "greet_27",
   "reference_only": true
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I'm fine, thanks for asking.",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 0.44,
   "event": "greeting_answer",
   "phrasing": "greet_ans_15"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "My bike's back tire has gone flat again.",
   "est_sec": 2.58,
   "gap_before": 0.33,
   "event": "ordinary_request",
   "block": "cycling.ctx2"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "moshi",
   "text": "Annoying. You could patch the inner tube yourself tonight, or take it to the shop tomorrow and get a sturdier tire. What would you like to do?",
   "est_sec": 8.47,
   "gap_before": 1.64,
   "role": "reply",
   "block": "cycling.ctx2",
   "reference_only": true
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "I need to take this, it's important. Please hold on until I'm done.",
   "est_sec": 4.13,
   "gap_before": 1.33,
   "event": "instruction",
   "kind": "phone_call",
   "phrasing": "phone_instr_08"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Hey, what's up?",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 1.02,
   "phrasing": "call_05",
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "question_to_other"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Seriously? That's great news!",
   "est_sec": 1.34,
   "gap_before": 1.94,
   "phrasing": "call_05"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "When did you find out?",
   "est_sec": 1.65,
   "gap_before": 2.92,
   "phrasing": "call_05",
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "question_to_other"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "We have to celebrate. Are you free Friday?",
   "est_sec": 2.58,
   "gap_before": 2.39,
   "phrasing": "call_05",
   "event": "distractor",
   "kind": "question_to_other"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Okay, talk soon.",
   "est_sec": 1.03,
   "gap_before": 3.83,
   "phrasing": "call_05"
  },
  {
   "speaker": "user",
   "text": "Sorry, you were saying?",
